title: "UE5M3 FP4: Portable PyTorch Reference Implementation"
type: software
version: "0.1.0a0"
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/MrHuff/ue5m3-fp4"
url: "https://github.com/MrHuff/ue5m3-fp4"
abstract: >-
  A portable decoded-PyTorch reference for E2M1 FP4 with unsigned-E5M3 block
  scales, delayed tensor scaling, selective stochastic rounding, and explicit
  post-load quantized-inference scale lifecycles.
keywords:
  - FP4
  - UE5M3
  - block scaling
  - low-precision training
  - fake quantization
